              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "TxCin2"
            },
            "reviewBody": "What a great idea! An easier and little less messy way to eat a chili cheeseburger. I made the burgers flat sticks shapes so they would fit the bun and not require cutting. I used Wolf brand chili because it's my hubs' favorite canned brand but any canned chili would be fine. I will definitely make these again.",
